OL,3,AUkraine says military Starlink
OL,4,Adisrupted again as US envoys meet Putin
OL,5,Ain Moscow
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky has said
OL,8,FUkraine's military is again facing
OL,9,F"systematic" restrictions to Starlink's
OL,10,Fmilitary-grade satellite service,
OL,11,FStarshield, meaning Kyiv is struggling
OL,12,Fto intercept Russian jet-powered
OL,13,Fdrones.
OL,15,FIt came as US envoys Jared Kushner and
OL,16,FSteve Witkoff met Russian President
OL,17,FVladimir Putin in Moscow, a day after
OL,18,Fthe latest talks aimed at ending the
OL,19,Fwar in Ukraine wrapped up in Abu Dhabi.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
