OL,3,AUkraine says military Starlink
OL,4,Adisrupted again as US envoys meet Putin
OL,5,Ain Moscow
OL,6,
OL,7,FZelensky told European leaders in
OL,8,FDublin that Ukraine was trying to clear
OL,9,Fup the Starlink situation with the
OL,10,FAmerican side.
OL,12,FBut he added "some things" were already
OL,13,Fclear: "If someone in America is making
OL,14,Fdecisions that basically treat
OL,15,FUkrainian territory as if it is not
OL,16,FUkrainian, then this tells us where
OL,17,Fthings are going."
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
