OL,3,ANew York mayor giving update after
OL,4,Aeight killed and 19 injured in building
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FSix adults and two children have been
OL,8,Fkilled after a three-storey building
OL,9,Fcollapsed in New York, mayor Zohran
OL,10,FMamdani says - watch live above
OL,12,FFirefighters arrived on the scene of
OL,13,Fthe "devastating" incident in less than
OL,14,Fone minute, Mamdani says, as he calls
OL,15,Ffor a "comprehensive and thorough"
OL,16,Finvestigation
OL,18,FFootage shows firefighters pulling one
OL,19,Fsurvivor out of the debris on a
OL,20,Fstretcher; dozens of emergency workers
OL,21,Fcontinue to scour the wreckage - this
OL,22,Fmap shows where it is
